    <ns0:title>v1.0.0</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;p&gt;After three release candidates, we are pleased to announce the official release of RAGFlow 1.0, now ready for production. Built on a complete rewrite in Go, this release significantly reduces deployment and runtime overhead and introduces an all-new Agentic Chat experience. We encourage all users to upgrade for improved stability, performance, and question answering.&lt;/p&gt;
